abstract: >-
  Current code and derived data are in releases/20261112, with four main
  figures and seventeen supplementary figures, reproduction instructions,
  original calculation provenance and validation records. Full source-field
  recalculation requires provider archives and path configuration. Statistical
  accounting does not establish causal attribution, and the documented archived
  initialization-selection limitation remains unresolved.
